---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Lake Tours & Overnight Experiences"
  description="Explore Cheow Lan Lake with full-day tours, overnight floating bungalow stays, private trips, and wildlife experiences in Khao Sok."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/khao-sok-national-park-11.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Lake Tours & Overnight Experiences"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Lake Cheow Lan Tours", "href": "/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="#fulldaylake" class="awb-menu__main-a awb-menu__main-a_button"><span class="menu-text fusion-button button-default button-small">Full Day</span></a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="#overnightcheowlan" class="awb-menu__main-a awb-menu__main-a_button"><span class="menu-text fusion-button button-default button-small">Overnight</span></a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="#private" class="awb-menu__main-a awb-menu__main-a_button"><span class="menu-text fusion-button button-default button-small">Private Tour</span></a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Explore Cheow Lan Lake</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok Lake is the highlight of the Khao Sok National Park, and consequently, one of the most scenic places to visit in Thailand. Riverside Cottages arranges several Cheow Lan lake tours. For example, a day trip with a visit to a cave, some trekking, time for a swim and lunch at a raft house. On the other hand, you can opt for a khao Sok overnight lake tour on which you will sleep in a floating <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">bungalow</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Overnight trips have a better chance of spotting wildlife in the early morning in addition to the late afternoon. We are also experts at arranging “wildlife explorer” safaris with private guides and, further, traditional Thai fishing tours.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Some activities on the lake are quite strenuous and may not be appropriate for every guest. We recommend guests with smaller children, and guests with difficulty moving contact us prior to booking a lake trip.
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to plan your stay</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Choose a <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Package</a> with a set program for best value
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Full Day Cheow Lan Lake Tours</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/N3IHmdwmzI8?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Experience beautiful scenery with tall limestone cliffs rising to the sky and over 100 islands. You will witness one of the most amazing places on earth. Start the day with a drive to a colorful local market, then cruise the lake in a traditional long tail boat.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Enjoy swimming in the refreshing emerald green waters. Choose between kayaking, hiking with a guide, or hanging at the bungalows to relax and swim.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Are you a keen nature enthusiast eager to see unusual animals? This is one of the easiest places in Thailand to spot leaf monkeys and hornbills. You can book a 3 day tour that includes a visit to the lake – please see our <a href="/khao-sok-lake-tour-rainforest/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Rainforest Adventure</a> package.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This is the most family-friendly of the tours, especially if you sit out the hike. You’ll want your camera to record the scenery, along with money for entrance to the National Park.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Duration:</strong> The tour lasts from 8:30am to 6:00pm, with lunch and an optional 2 hour trek.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <div class="fusion-button-wrapper fusion-aligncenter"><a href="/khao-sok-lake-tour-rainforest/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><span class="fusion-button-text awb-button__text awb-button__text--default">Rainforest Adventure Package</span></a></div><i class="fb-icon-element-1 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>You can find more information on the day trip to Cheow Lan
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Overnight lake tour</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/06CtCq41X6o?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="my-10 max-w-[340px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black aspect-[9/16]">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zlA4MJ4AzD4?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The best way to appreciate the lake is on an overnight tour. On your first day you will experience everything included in the 1-day trip. Board a longtail boat for an incredible wildlife safari to spot the local wildlife. You can expect to see monkeys, giant hornbills, and maybe even wild elephants.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          As evening arrives visit your floating restaurant to dine on fresh fish from the lake and stir-fried veggies. Spend a memorable night under the stars in your own private floating bungalow.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-2 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i>Both overnight experiences include time on Cheow Lan Lake and a stay in floating bungalows, combined with accommodation at Riverside Cottages.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Private Overnight Lake Tours</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTj1qcYTpBM?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="my-10 max-w-[340px] mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black aspect-[9/16]">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/6wy6o6iIbbE?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you do not want to join a group, we can set up private tours. These tours offer flexible activities and choices of floating bungalows. Options include bamboo raft houses (with shared bathrooms) or deluxe bungalows with private bathrooms and air-conditioning.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Beyond room choice, you can adjust the program to allow more time for hiking, relaxing, or wildlife viewing. This makes the private overnight lake trip ideal for families or those wanting a bit of luxury. Tours begin at Ratchaprapha Dam. We can help you arrange transport from Surat Thani province or anywhere in Southern Thailand.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Duration: 1-2 nights, with a private guide and boat to accompany you.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <i class="fb-icon-element-3 fb-icon-element fontawesome-icon fa-info fas circle-no fusion-text-flow" style="--awb-iconcolor:var(--awb-color7);--awb-iconcolor-hover:var(--awb-color7);--awb-font-size:20px;--awb-margin-right:10px;"></i><a href="/contact-khao-sok-riverside-cottages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Contact us</a> to book a private Khao Sok lake tour — we’ll send you the price and program.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What you need to know before visiting Cheow Lan lake</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake has beautiful scenery, but it is still a remote place. Visiting the lake is considered one of the <a href="/top-6-activities-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">top experiences in Khao Sok National Park</a>. For this reason, please take time to understand what you are getting into.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Armed with the right information about what to expect, you can have a fun, safe lake trip. You should learn about the Cheow Lan Lake floating houses before deciding to stay in them. Here’s what you need to know:
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/khao-sok-national-park-11.jpg"
            alt="floating rafts on Cheow Lan Lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">floating rafts on Cheow Lan Lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>The Good, the Bad, and the Jungle</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake is one of the most beautiful places in Thailand, but it is important to understand that this is still a remote rainforest environment — not a luxury resort destination designed for everyone.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>The Good</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The scenery can be extraordinary. Towering limestone cliffs rise directly from the lake, jungle mist drifts across the water in the early morning, and wildlife still moves through the surrounding rainforest. Spending a night in <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">floating bungalows on Cheow Lan lake</a> is a unique experience and, for many visitors, becomes the highlight of their time in Khao Sok National Park.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>The Bad</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Conditions on the lake can change quickly. Weather is unpredictable, boat journeys can be long, and some raft houses are very basic with limited electricity, WiFi, and facilities. The lake has also become increasingly popular in recent years, especially during high season, so some areas may feel busier than visitors expect.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>The Jungle</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake is part of an ancient rainforest ecosystem. Wildlife sightings are never guaranteed, and nature operates on its own schedule. Heavy rain, intense heat, insects, muddy trails, and changing conditions are all part of the experience. Medical facilities are far away, and visitors should arrive prepared for a genuine outdoor adventure rather than a perfectly controlled tourist attraction.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For travelers who appreciate nature, atmosphere, and adventure, these realities are often part of what makes Cheow Lan Lake so memorable. If you would like to experience the lake for yourself, you can explore our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok tour packages</a> and overnight lake experiences.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Which Lake Experience Is Right for You?</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/70 shadow-md">
          <table width="100%"><thead><tr><th align="left"><strong>Experience</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Best For</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Duration</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Overnight Stay</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">Full-Day Lake Tour</td><td align="left">Families, shorter stays, first-time visitors</td><td align="left">Full day</td><td align="left">No</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Overnight Lake Tour</td><td align="left">Nature lovers, photographers, slower travel</td><td align="left">2 days / 1 night</td><td align="left">Yes</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Private Lake Tour</td><td align="left">Couples, families, flexible itineraries</td><td align="left">Flexible</td><td align="left">Optional</td></tr></tbody></table>
        </div>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/THAILAND_D2546.jpg"
            alt="Cheow Lan lake bungalow"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Cheow Lan lake bungalow</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849.jpg"
            alt="Cheow Lan lake boat trip"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Cheow Lan lake boat trip</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Checklist – what to bring to Cheow Larn Lake</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>300 Baht <a href="/khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">National Park</a> Entrance Fee (150 for children under 10)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Sun protection – hat, sunscreen, long sleeves</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Swimsuit</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Headlamp or torch</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Hiking clothes – Be prepared for them to get dirty.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Hiking shoes (we recommend tennis/running shoes)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Mosquito repellent for hiking</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Extra clothes for the van ride back to Khao Sok (it can get cold with the A/C on)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Towel – the floating raft houses will sometimes run behind on laundry</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Please note that the national park does not allow plastic bags at the lake.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Read more <a href="/khao-sok-blog/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">blogs</a> and visit our <a href="/khao-sok-faqs/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">FAQs</a> for more information.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>The Story of Cheow Lan Lake</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake may look ancient, but it is actually a relatively recent addition to the landscape of Khao Sok National Park. Created in 1987 with the construction of Ratchaprapha Dam, the lake flooded a vast valley of rainforest, limestone hills, and small communities — transforming the area into one of Thailand’s most extraordinary natural destinations.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Today, long-tail boats drift between towering limestone karsts that rise dramatically from emerald water, while floating raft houses offer visitors the chance to stay deep within the protected rainforest. Misty mornings, jungle sounds, and the sheer scale of the landscape create an atmosphere that feels far removed from Thailand’s busy beaches and cities.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Despite its popularity, Cheow Lan Lake remains a remote wilderness. Dense rainforest surrounds the lake, wildlife still moves through the hills and waterways, and changing weather conditions constantly reshape the scenery. For many visitors, spending time on the lake becomes the highlight of their journey through southern Thailand.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Read the complete history and guide to Cheow Lan Lake</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For more information about the lake’s history, wildlife, floating bungalows, seasons, and travel tips, please visit our<br /> <a href="/cheow-lan-lake-information-guide/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Lan Lake Guide</a>
        </p>
        <div class="my-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
              <img
